WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:07.157
This shipment evidence pack connects plot, batch, container and carbon records in one portable file.

2
00:00:07.107 --> 00:00:12.316
A forwarder or broker submits the shipment details through its existing workflow.

3
00:00:12.316 --> 00:00:20.961
The evidence is then bound, frozen and publicly anchored, while filing fields and exceptions are made visible to the importer.

4
00:00:20.961 --> 00:00:29.113
The pack supports EUDR and CBAM preparation, but the legally responsible operator still files its own declaration.

5
00:00:29.113 --> 00:00:33.253
It does not certify compliance or guarantee customs clearance.

6
00:00:33.253 --> 00:00:38.527
Public verification is included, and subsequent changes create a new version.
